<Layout title="Website terms"><PageHero eyebrow="WEBSITE TERMS" title="Understand the starting point." text="The terms that apply to use of this website and initial registration."/><article class="container prose"><p>Effective 11 November 2026.</p><h2>Private immigration services</h2><p>This website is operated for Verto Immigration Inc., a private service business. It is independent of the Government of Canada and IRCC. Government forms and instructions are available directly from official government sources.</p><h2>Initial registration</h2><p>The registration form is an enquiry and intake tool. Submitting it does not file a government application, establish eligibility or create a representative-client agreement. A separate written service agreement must identify the paid work and the applicable terms.</p><h2>Information and outcomes</h2><p>Website information is general and does not replace advice about your specific circumstances. Immigration requirements and fees can change. Authorities control decisions and processing times. No approval, employment opportunity or timeline is guaranteed.</p><h2>Your responsibilities</h2><p>Provide accurate information about yourself and only information you are authorized to share. Do not send unrelated sensitive documents, use the site unlawfully, attempt unauthorized access or interfere with the service. Initial online registration is intended for adults; a parent or guardian should contact Verto about a minor’s circumstances.</p><h2>Fees and payment</h2><p>Confirm the written scope, total fee, taxes, payment recipient, separate government charges and cancellation terms before paying. The stated Verto application fee is CAD $622. The payment service may display a different merchant name, which must be disclosed and clarified before payment. Payment does not guarantee an immigration result.</p><h2>Privacy and private links</h2><p>Read the <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a>. Keep tracking links and access keys confidential. Do not share them publicly.</p><h2>External links and availability</h2><p>Links to official sources and other organizations are provided for convenience. Those organizations control their own content and services. The website may be unavailable during maintenance or a service interruption.</p><h2>Questions or concerns</h2><p>Contact <a href="mailto:travel@vertoimmigrationinc.com">travel@vertoimmigrationinc.com</a>. These website terms do not override rights that cannot be excluded under applicable law or the terms of your signed service agreement.</p></article></Layout>
